  "description": "<p><strong>All credits to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/3407-nootropix/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Nootropix</a> i just fixed it up for latest version 3.8.0 and did a few tweeks because it was so powerful</strong></p>\n<p>This mod adds an extra injector that heals any wound, be it bleeds, contusions, broken or even blacked out limbs and only takes a couple of seconds to do it! (bit like my sex life!)</p>\n<p>It even includes a mighty opioid dose with every use which lasts 180secs.</p>\n<p>You’ll still need to use it multiple times to heal everything, but at least it’s quick!</p>\n<p>Costs 50k from Therapist Loyalty Level I or from the Flea Market.</p>\n<p>No need to take up your valuable secure container space with meds. This thing does it all.</p>\n",
